verses.raw_usfm:
A daughter is a secret cause of wakefulness to a father.  
\q2 Care for her takes away sleep—  
\q2 in her youth, lest she pass the flower of her age;  
\q2 when she is married, lest she should be hated;   
\q2

in her virginity, lest she should be defiled and be with child in her father’s house;  
\q2 when she has a husband, lest she should transgress;  
\q2 and when she is married, lest she should be barren.   
\q1
